{"t": 2.9, "ms": 53, "by": "agent", "tool": "brush_list", "args": {}, "error": false, "text": "0: Wrinkle [built-in] - Fine, sharp creases for skin folds and fabric wrinkles.\n1: Palette Knife [built-in] - Flattens and drags clay sideways like a sculptor's knife.\n2: Dragon Scales [built-in] - Stamps rounded overlapping scales along the stroke.\n3: Stone Carve [built-in] - Scrapes hard planes and breaks them up with cracks for rocks and ruins.\n4: Skin Pores [built-in] - Sprinkles tiny pores for close-up skin detail.\n5: Clay Slab [built-in] - Builds up flat-topped strokes of clay for blocking in forms.\n6: Edge Wear [built-in] - Chips and softens only the sharp edges and ridges, for weathered props.\n7: Block Former [built-in, Clay & Form] - Big, flat-topped clay strokes that stack fast, for blocking in primary forms.\n8: Soft Clay [built-in, Clay & Form] - Gentle round clay that builds in thin layers and blends into the surface.\n9: Clay Strip [built-in, Clay & Form] - Narrow, crisp strips of clay with a hard edge, for muscle fibres and planes.\n10: Plane Cutter [built-in, Clay & Form] - Shaves the surface down to flat planes, for stylised forms and stone.\n11: Volume Fill [built-in, Clay & Form] - Fills low areas up to the stroke's plane and leaves the high points alone.\n12: Level Out [built-in, Clay & Form] - Presses hills and valleys onto one plane and softens the result, to calm busy areas.\n13: Swell [built-in, Clay & Form] - Puffs the surface out along its own normals, for cheeks, bellies and soft volumes.\n14: Form Smoother [built-in, Clay & Form] - Relaxes lumps while keeping the big shape, for a clean pass after blocking.\n15: Clay Drag [built-in, Clay & Form] - Smears soft clay along the stroke like a thumb pushing it, for blending transitions.\n16: Edge Definer [built-in, Clay & Form] - Pinches a crisp edge into the surface where two planes meet.\n17: Panel Groove [built-in, Hard Surface] - Cuts a clean, narrow groove for panel gaps and seams.\n18: Flat Plane [built-in, Hard Surface] - Presses a perfectly flat face with a hard edge, for machined surfaces.\n19: Cri", "images": []}
